.env
secrets.env
config.yaml
outpost.db
outpost.db-shm
outpost.db-wal
outpost.db.lock
# The built binaries live at the repo root. Anchored, because a bare `outpost`
# also matched cmd/outpost/ and silently ignored new files there.
/outpost
/outpost-arm64
# Fetched modpacks: one directory per profile, plus the .mrpack cache. Both the
# CLI and the page write here.
/pack/
/packs/
# The deployed state, on the box: config.yaml, the database, packs and the SSH key
# live in data/ because it is bind-mounted at /data in the container (PLAN 38).
/data/
# The host update watcher's flock and its mailbox, both created beside
# docker-compose.yml (deploy/watcher, internal/updatesignal).
/.update-watcher.lock
/update-signal/

# Gradle's caches and outputs. The mod's sources are tracked; a decompiled
# Minecraft jar and 70 MB of remapped loom cache are not, and were committed by
# accident once.
/mod/.gradle/
/mod/build/
node_modules/
.wrangler/
web/node_modules/
web/.svelte-kit/
# The built frontend is NOT committed: the image build runs `pnpm build` fresh
# from web/src (Dockerfile), and `go:embed all:build` needs it on disk, so a cold
# clone runs `make web` before `go build`. See PLAN 38.
web/build/
